  "full_text": "So, tapeworms are the same shape as retarded. So they said a human could probably outrun a T-Rex. I was just thinking T-Rex. I was thinking of Diana as the T-Rex. Then I started thinking about Terry as the T-Rex. So I have to be careful. I started using the third person to talk about myself and confuse people. Anyway, you never know how you look in other people's eyes. I don't even see what the point is. I think everybody has seen it. Well, Terry doesn't even know what a warthog is. I guess this is, God said, Psalm number one says, Blessed is the man whose delight is meditation on the law of the Lord. Terry thought it was the same thing. So, like, Jews are very strict about, this feels a little bit stupid. A little bit, not stupid, but I was listening to, he says, it doesn't hurt God. And then I disagreed with him. It's wrong to... wrong to promote. See, here's what happens. When you start making God lofty, this is where I can be. They probably know this already. Satan, for my people, is the leaven of the Pharisees. And when you say God can't have his feelings hurt, you forgot about Abba. How do you reconcile Abba Father with... God who can't have his feelings hurt. So that is blasphemy. Then what did I do? I aborted. I stopped the video. So here's the question. A Jew says, oh, okay, so you made yourself your own religion. We're going to prosecute you for blasphemy. You're like, what?",
